1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,435
The fandom organized around the gap.

2
00:00:02,435 --> 00:00:06,314
Message boards ran recovery wishes in a dozen languages.

3
00:00:06,314 --> 00:00:10,167
Fan projects adopted her symbol before there was an official one.

4
00:00:10,167 --> 00:00:18,144
And in March 2024, the company that never leaks let one sentence out of the building: the seventh member was returning.

5
00:00:18,144 --> 00:00:20,180
The debut had been a launch window.

6
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:21,443
This was the payload.

